[7:45a.m.] #ThirdMainlandBridge #3MB #TrafficUpdate 

Traffic is good as you approach the Third Mainland Bridge from Olopomeji inwards Berger (Iyana Oworo), ILaje, Unilag Water Front, approaching Adekunkle where it starts getting slow inwards Adeniji.

Our Men are strategically located to ensure traffic is good.

